    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, hack, and kidnap as you lead cybernetic agents in real time tactical combat with pause. Upgrade your team, brainwash enemy agents, and deploy informants as you wage war on your enemies for control of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear Buildings</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a team of agents on missions to hack, steal, and kidnap from rival agencies to increase your resources and influence in the city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/e24cecaeafa61ef5c3ac2619506bbddc.poster.avif?t=1754581902\" width=572 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/e24cecaeafa61ef5c3ac2619506bbddc.webm?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/e24cecaeafa61ef5c3ac2619506bbddc.mp4?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Agents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions change gear, equipment, and weapons to match the needs of the job and your plans. Graft enhancements onto your agents in the lab creating an unstoppable super soldier or an expendable glass cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/1b2536b86b40ae0b0540e635f9036113.poster.avif?t=1754581902\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/1b2536b86b40ae0b0540e635f9036113.webm?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/1b2536b86b40ae0b0540e635f9036113.mp4?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new agents by various means to expand your network of informants, improve your medical lab, and secure your market position in the city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/285419c091495f811bd3e33c19e52532.poster.avif?t=1754581902\" width=570 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/285419c091495f811bd3e33c19e52532.webm?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/285419c091495f811bd3e33c19e52532.mp4?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your network of informants to discover your rival's weaknesses and then undertake missions to exploit them to expand your influence, increase funding, and eliminate your rivals in the city.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/0910ed863067fb50a8176abe821a1428.poster.avif?t=1754581902\" width=570 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/0910ed863067fb50a8176abe821a1428.webm?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985970/extras/0910ed863067fb50a8176abe821a1428.mp4?t=1754581902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
